The '''Prison of the Bereft''' was a location found on the [[Hub Island]] while {{NPCSprite|Candidate Aura;Aura}} was in office. It was a metal cage where players were sent to for a duration of {{Green|5}} minutes for committing various offenses.

== Game Message ==
When a player was sent to prison, a message appeared for everyone in the lobby:
{{Dialogue|&c&lJAILED! &7<player> &fhas been sent to jail!}}

Players were sent into the cage by doing one of the following:
* Punching a {{NPCSprite|Goon}}
* Using the <code>/killaura</code> command
* Sending "Aura Sucks", "Aura Bad", "Screw Aura", or similar in the chat (includes profanity)

When sent to the '''Prison of the Bereft''', the following text displayed:

:{{Dialogue|
&c&lINSOLENT!
&7You have been sent to jail for &e5m&7.
}}
While in prison, the player couldn't warp anywhere and the <code>/killaura</code> command was disabled. Additionally, throwing {{Item|Ender Pearl}}s and summoning [[Pets]] were disabled.

== Prison Break ==
After the first [[Minister Election]] ended, {{RN|yt|im_a_squid_kid}} was placed in jail instead of becoming Minister. A {{NPCSprite|Corrupt Goon}} appeared in the basement of the {{Zone|Hexatorum}} to sell a {{Item|Rusty Spoon}} that could be used to participate in breaking the cage. Once the '''Prison of the Bereft''' was broken, players could no longer be jailed.

== Prison Reconstruction ==
At the end of the second [[Minister Election]], the '''Prison of the Bereft''' was repaired. It swapped from wood to metal and placed {{Green|3}} {{NPCSprite|Guard Goon;Guard Goons}} and a {{NPCSprite|Judicial Goon}} around it. This allowed players to be jailed again; in addition, {{RN|MVP|Confused_Goon}} was placed in the jail.

Following the eighth [[Minister Election]], {{NPCSprite|SnowflakeKiwi}} was imprisoned for attempting to remove the {{AN|Work Smarter}} perk.

At the ninth and last [[Minister Election]], all methods to be imprisoned were disabled.

Following {{NPCSprite|Candidate Aura;Aura}}'s leave from office, the '''Prison of the Bereft''' was removed.

== Trivia ==
* Once {{NPCSprite|Candidate Aura;Aura}} was elected, a {{NPCSprite|Goon}} was seen building the cage block by block until completion.
* If a player attempted any of the actions that sent them to jail again while their sentence wasn't over, they were sent back to jail and the timer reset.
* It was possible to escape the '''Prison of the Bereft''' in multiple ways, such as using an {{Item|Ender Pearl}} or {{Item|Horse Pet}}/{{Item|Skeleton Horse Pet}}. However, the game still classified the player as imprisoned. If the player warped away from the [[Hub Island]], they were sent back shortly after.
* [[Minister Election|Ministers]] that betrayed {{NPCSprite|Candidate Aura;Aura}} were imprisoned for the duration of their term.
* While {{NPCSprite|Aura}} and her {{NPCSprite|Goon}}s were present on the [[Alpha Hypixel Network]], the '''Prison of the Bereft''' was not.
* ''Bereft'' means 'lacking in something'.

